<title>FINLAND: RESEARCH ALERT-NATWEST HAS POHJOLA HOLD.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-NATWEST HAS POHJOLA HOLD.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities recommended &quot;hold&quot; for Finnish insurer Vakuutusosakeyhtio Pohjola in a three-month, and &quot;add&quot; in a one-year perspective in an European insurance sector update dated March 21.</p>
<p>NatWest did not give its previous recommendations for Pohjola, but said Scandinavian insurance stocks were highly exposed to any falls in financial markets.</p>
<p>&quot;The German, Scandinavian and Swiss stocks ... are all highly exposed to any falls in financial markets,&quot; Natwest said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
